  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "進階可程式控制(含實驗)",
    "sub_ename": "ADVANCED PROGRAMMABLE LOGIC CONTROL (WITH EXPERIMENT)",
    "describe_ch": "了解純熟運用可程式控制器指令設計各項控制程式，同時介紹一般控制電路之元件種類、型式、功能、用途及如何設計應用回路之配線，進而以實例撰寫應用程式，再配合機電輸出裝置予以控制該等裝置或設備的作動，以達熟能生巧之控制程式應用目的，此外該課程可作為油氣壓、人機界面控制及機電整合控制技術之基礎。藉由本課程學生可學習到:\n 1. PLC運用命令解說與實習，2. PLC與周邊電路元件、感測元件配線，3. PLC與特殊模組相接的設計，4. 機電整合控制案例實作與週邊模組參數設定。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is mainly aimed at the training student to apply the command design and programming of PLC skillfully. In addition, categories, types, function, and employ of circuit element will be introduced. Finally, students will practice the application of Mitsubishi PLC in control system for industry applications. This course can be used as the basis of the technologies of hydraulics and pneumatics, human machine interface control and mechatronics. The main purposes of PLC course are shown as follows:\n 1. PLC command explanation and practice\n 2. Circuit wiring between PLC and peripheral circuit components and sensing element.\n 3. PLC and special modules connected design.\n 4. Mechanical integration control case implementation and peripheral modules parameter setting.",
    "pre_subname": "AUTO3026可程式控制(含實驗)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "AUTO3026",
    "pre_sub_ename": "AUTO3026 PROGRAMMABLE  LOGIC  CONTROL (WITH EXPERIMENT)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
